WEBVTT

00:00:02.080 --> 00:00:09.170
(Chūka Ichiban)

00:01:32.920 --> 00:01:34.310
On my study trip,

00:01:34.480 --> 00:01:36.580
we arrived at Quqing Village.

00:01:37.050 --> 00:01:39.700
Miss Yanli, the chef of Quqing Restaurant,

00:01:39.810 --> 00:01:41.490
asked me to make the mysterious rice crust

00:01:41.760 --> 00:01:44.500
that has been lost for more than thirty years.

00:01:45.310 --> 00:01:47.350
I finally solved the puzzle.

00:01:48.140 --> 00:01:48.690
But I did not expect...

00:01:51.810 --> 00:01:52.230
Proconsulate Lian,

00:01:53.140 --> 00:01:55.540
I have solved

00:01:55.590 --> 00:01:57.610
the mystery of the rice crust dish.

00:01:58.040 --> 00:01:59.410
How could it be her?

00:01:59.580 --> 00:02:00.930
Where is Mao?

00:02:07.700 --> 00:02:10.680
Revive! Mystery Scorched Rice Cuisine

00:02:21.350 --> 00:02:22.060
I heard that Miss Yanli

00:02:22.110 --> 00:02:24.180
solved the mystery of the Rice Crust Dish.

00:02:24.570 --> 00:02:25.120
She deserves to be

00:02:25.170 --> 00:02:27.200
the chef of Quqing Restaurant.

00:02:36.810 --> 00:02:38.600
Mao! Silang!

00:02:45.160 --> 00:02:46.670
It's weird. Where did they go?

00:02:47.640 --> 00:02:48.560
It’s too weird!

00:02:48.610 --> 00:02:49.510
She left the puzzle to Mao.

00:02:49.580 --> 00:02:50.940
How could she do it?

00:02:52.970 --> 00:02:56.280
Mao! Silang!

00:02:59.210 --> 00:03:02.450
Mao! Silang!

00:03:08.160 --> 00:03:10.840
Mao! Silang!

00:03:17.200 --> 00:03:20.510
You’re a real chef.

00:03:20.730 --> 00:03:21.990
The legendary cuisine

00:03:22.040 --> 00:03:23.850
is going to be cooked again

00:03:24.110 --> 00:03:25.630
by Master Jia Xiong’s granddaughter.

00:03:26.520 --> 00:03:27.690
It's up to you, Yanli.

00:03:29.440 --> 00:03:30.600
Proconsulate Lian,

00:03:30.950 --> 00:03:32.800
Please take a closer look

00:03:33.070 --> 00:03:34.500
how I will cook

00:03:34.770 --> 00:03:36.450
my grandfather’s mysterious rice crust.

00:03:47.200 --> 00:03:48.240
What is that?

00:03:48.290 --> 00:03:50.170
What is that ball?

00:03:50.770 --> 00:03:51.990
Get chains ready!

00:04:21.640 --> 00:04:23.010
Iron ball, get ready.

00:04:32.900 --> 00:04:34.400
Light the fire.

00:04:52.000 --> 00:04:53.350
It's so spectacular!

00:04:53.430 --> 00:04:54.950
Turns out it’s made in this way.

00:04:59.160 --> 00:05:01.960
Mao! Silang!

00:05:03.250 --> 00:05:05.080
Where did you go?

00:05:05.290 --> 00:05:06.300
Do I have to

00:05:06.350 --> 00:05:07.980
search the whole village?

00:05:49.650 --> 00:05:51.560
Mao! Silang!

00:06:14.800 --> 00:06:15.850
So delicious smell!

00:06:15.970 --> 00:06:16.950
Just like old times.

00:06:36.190 --> 00:06:38.170
That's right. That’s the shape.

00:06:38.530 --> 00:06:39.260
There is no doubt

00:06:39.310 --> 00:06:41.030
that it’s Master Jia Xiong’s dish.

00:06:43.140 --> 00:06:44.450
It seems delicious!

00:06:45.010 --> 00:06:46.820
What an amazing shock!

00:06:46.910 --> 00:06:48.840
This strange big ball

00:06:49.040 --> 00:06:50.350
turned out to be a cooking tool.

00:06:50.950 --> 00:06:53.020
I ate this dish for the first time

00:06:53.400 --> 00:06:54.310
at 12 years old

00:06:54.350 --> 00:06:55.490
when I failed the imperial examination

00:06:55.540 --> 00:06:56.830
and fell into despair.

00:07:01.310 --> 00:07:02.240
Darn it.

00:07:03.010 --> 00:07:05.030
I studied so hard

00:07:05.400 --> 00:07:06.410
but still failed the imperial examination.

00:07:06.590 --> 00:07:07.290
Do not give up.

00:07:09.190 --> 00:07:10.180
What's this?

00:07:12.450 --> 00:07:13.410
- How could it...
- Young man,

00:07:13.640 --> 00:07:14.660
eat this.

00:07:14.720 --> 00:07:15.700
Get yourself together.

00:07:17.810 --> 00:07:19.370
The dish served by Master Jia Xiong

00:07:19.790 --> 00:07:21.340
seemed to have magic power.

00:07:21.390 --> 00:07:23.270
It surprised me

00:07:23.920 --> 00:07:26.330
and even cheered on me.

00:07:26.740 --> 00:07:27.840
Because of the dish,

00:07:27.890 --> 00:07:29.430
I pulled myself together.

00:07:31.470 --> 00:07:34.030
That's right.

00:07:34.120 --> 00:07:35.540
This moment is even more irresistible.

00:07:36.720 --> 00:07:38.490
Please wait a while.

00:07:47.440 --> 00:07:49.060
It’s not only

00:07:49.380 --> 00:07:50.960
a rice crust dish,

00:07:51.260 --> 00:07:52.030
but almost like

00:07:52.080 --> 00:07:54.210
the masterpiece in cooking.

00:07:54.510 --> 00:07:55.380
Turns out this is the legendary

00:07:55.430 --> 00:07:57.240
rice crust.

00:07:57.620 --> 00:07:58.790
Proconsulate Lian,

00:07:59.010 --> 00:08:00.960
please taste it now.

00:08:07.420 --> 00:08:08.420
See

00:08:08.620 --> 00:08:09.220
this is what you got

00:08:09.270 --> 00:08:10.860
from the honey trap.

00:08:10.940 --> 00:08:13.590
You really deserve it!

00:08:14.410 --> 00:08:15.490
Poor guy.

00:08:15.580 --> 00:08:17.300
Just say whatever you want.

00:08:17.540 --> 00:08:19.290
No, it won’t work.

00:08:19.590 --> 00:08:21.120
What are you talking about?

00:08:21.350 --> 00:08:21.960
It won’t work?

00:08:22.010 --> 00:08:22.760
What won’t work?

00:08:23.280 --> 00:08:25.310
Just knowing how to use the tools

00:08:25.400 --> 00:08:26.200
is still not enough.

00:08:26.770 --> 00:08:27.510
If only in that way,

00:08:27.660 --> 00:08:29.730
the mysterious rice crust can’t be made.

00:08:31.550 --> 00:08:32.230
What's wrong?

00:08:32.740 --> 00:08:33.580
What happened?

00:08:35.320 --> 00:08:38.160
Excuse me. I beg your pardon.

00:08:38.690 --> 00:08:40.090
What you mean is...

00:08:45.240 --> 00:08:45.870
I mean

00:08:46.170 --> 00:08:48.530
this is not Master Jia Xiong’s Rice Crust

00:08:48.570 --> 00:08:49.990
I ate before.

00:08:50.700 --> 00:08:51.750
How could it be possible?

00:08:52.350 --> 00:08:53.490
It's a pity.

00:08:54.220 --> 00:08:57.290
It seems that the dish is really lost.

00:08:57.400 --> 00:08:59.960
It can only be a legendary delicacy forever.

00:09:00.350 --> 00:09:02.900
But just for my nostalgia,

00:09:03.110 --> 00:09:03.740
you guys have been busy.

00:09:03.790 --> 00:09:04.700
I’m really sorry.

00:09:06.090 --> 00:09:07.020
Let's go.

00:09:12.500 --> 00:09:13.380
Wait a second, please.

00:09:17.040 --> 00:09:18.200
Please let me cook

00:09:18.360 --> 00:09:19.560
the mysterious rice crust for you.

00:09:20.100 --> 00:09:21.460
What? The kid wants to cook.

00:09:22.610 --> 00:09:23.550
Is he

00:09:23.600 --> 00:09:25.530
your chef here?

00:09:26.400 --> 00:09:27.320
Well, he’s...

00:09:27.700 --> 00:09:29.070
Proconsulate Lian, I beg you.

00:09:29.900 --> 00:09:31.480
Please give me a chance.

00:09:31.530 --> 00:09:32.050
Let me do it.

00:09:32.370 --> 00:09:32.950
Mao.

00:09:33.040 --> 00:09:35.240
Meili, don't worry.

00:09:36.430 --> 00:09:37.420
Right.

00:09:37.460 --> 00:09:39.030
It’s a big loss for you if you leave now.

00:09:39.240 --> 00:09:40.650
Though Mao and the Sexy woman

00:09:40.860 --> 00:09:43.600
are both chefs,

00:09:43.650 --> 00:09:45.000
their cooking skills are very different.

00:09:45.360 --> 00:09:46.170
Kid,

00:09:46.660 --> 00:09:48.150
how can you be so rude to the Proconsulate?

00:09:55.250 --> 00:09:56.790
Hey, didn’t you come here

00:09:56.840 --> 00:09:59.140
for the mysterious rice crust?

00:09:59.200 --> 00:10:00.300
If you don’t want to eat,

00:10:00.340 --> 00:10:02.320
it's not a big deal for us.

00:10:02.970 --> 00:10:04.500
Am I right, Mao?

00:10:04.560 --> 00:10:05.830
- This kid...
- Wait a moment!

00:10:06.200 --> 00:10:07.200
OK, I see.

00:10:07.570 --> 00:10:08.380
You can have a try.

00:10:08.980 --> 00:10:09.380
Yes.

00:10:09.850 --> 00:10:11.210
That's right.

00:10:11.520 --> 00:10:12.600
Is that kid serious?

00:10:12.660 --> 00:10:14.050
I think he can't wait to

00:10:14.100 --> 00:10:15.110
be imprisoned.

00:10:20.680 --> 00:10:21.730
Are you ready, Silang?

00:10:22.010 --> 00:10:22.630
Yes, I am.

00:10:29.930 --> 00:10:31.640
I thought he had a special way.

00:10:31.900 --> 00:10:33.180
Turns out it’s the same

00:10:50.760 --> 00:10:51.960
spherical rice crust.

00:10:52.440 --> 00:10:53.360
What he made

00:10:53.410 --> 00:10:54.970
is still the same as mine.

00:10:55.270 --> 00:10:56.340
What’s the difference?

00:10:57.570 --> 00:10:58.170
Nothing different.

00:10:58.280 --> 00:10:58.910
What he did

00:10:58.960 --> 00:11:00.330
is just the same as Miss Yanli’s.

00:11:00.970 --> 00:11:01.740
He is just

00:11:01.790 --> 00:11:03.680
imitating Miss Yanli.

00:11:04.960 --> 00:11:07.000
Mao, why didn’t you cook the sauce?

00:11:07.810 --> 00:11:08.690
That’s right.

00:11:09.280 --> 00:11:10.360
Without sauce,

00:11:10.410 --> 00:11:12.150
the rice crust will not be ready.

00:11:12.650 --> 00:11:14.390
Did you forget, kid?

00:11:16.790 --> 00:11:19.000
Well, you’ll know it later.

00:11:20.600 --> 00:11:22.550
The lost rice crust

00:11:22.640 --> 00:11:23.510
is about to finish now.

00:11:26.260 --> 00:11:27.650
Now, count to three.

00:11:28.110 --> 00:11:30.780
The legendary cuisine

00:11:30.880 --> 00:11:32.090
will come back.

00:11:32.520 --> 00:11:33.270
What?

00:11:33.580 --> 00:11:34.590
What do you mean?

00:11:42.400 --> 00:11:43.990
(Chūka Ichiban)

00:11:47.200 --> 00:11:48.640
Count to three.

00:11:49.120 --> 00:11:51.810
The legendary cuisine

00:11:51.980 --> 00:11:53.230
will come back.

00:11:53.640 --> 00:11:54.240
What?

00:11:54.560 --> 00:11:55.640
What do you mean?

00:11:55.740 --> 00:11:57.720
OK, just do it.

00:11:58.570 --> 00:11:59.030
Three.

00:12:01.110 --> 00:12:01.740
Two.

00:12:03.270 --> 00:12:03.680
One.

00:12:10.710 --> 00:12:11.800
Still the same as mine.

00:12:12.100 --> 00:12:12.730
Kid.

00:12:12.780 --> 00:12:14.840
You just talk glibly.

00:12:15.350 --> 00:12:17.110
Kid, I will never

00:12:17.160 --> 00:12:19.050
let you fool the Proconsulate.

00:12:19.910 --> 00:12:20.350
What happened?

00:12:20.400 --> 00:12:21.230
There is hot air.

00:12:26.510 --> 00:12:27.700
What happened?

00:13:05.390 --> 00:13:06.160
This is...

00:13:12.950 --> 00:13:15.540
It gets cracked by itself.

00:13:15.910 --> 00:13:16.860
The sauce is inside.

00:13:19.510 --> 00:13:22.470
Master Jia Xiong’s mysterious rice crust

00:13:22.700 --> 00:13:23.670
is finished.

00:13:24.450 --> 00:13:25.490
Yeah!

00:13:25.600 --> 00:13:26.970
What’s up? What happened?

00:13:27.050 --> 00:13:28.230
What’s going on?

00:13:28.500 --> 00:13:30.140
He didn’t drizzle the sauce on it.

00:13:30.330 --> 00:13:32.330
The sauce is inside the rice crust.

00:13:32.800 --> 00:13:34.970
Amazing. It’s like a magic.

00:13:35.620 --> 00:13:36.490
Mao!

00:13:40.800 --> 00:13:42.300
It’s amazing.

00:13:42.850 --> 00:13:45.480
This is the real mysterious rice crust.

00:13:46.090 --> 00:13:47.860
Grandfather’s cuisine

00:13:47.910 --> 00:13:49.000
is cooked again.

00:13:49.400 --> 00:13:50.620
Proconsulate Lian.

00:13:51.030 --> 00:13:52.640
Please have a try.

00:13:53.760 --> 00:13:54.930
OK, let me try it.

00:13:58.080 --> 00:13:58.730
It is exactly

00:13:59.640 --> 00:14:01.720
the irresistible scent,

00:14:02.270 --> 00:14:04.930
and the happiness before the sauce

00:14:35.370 --> 00:14:38.080
is mixed with the rice crust.

00:14:56.380 --> 00:14:59.820
These fried rice crusts are golden

00:15:00.110 --> 00:15:01.220
crispy and refreshing.

00:15:01.310 --> 00:15:05.030
The scent is emitted from the rice crust,

00:15:05.780 --> 00:15:07.000
sweet and rich.

00:15:07.500 --> 00:15:08.050
It’s absolutely right.

00:15:08.100 --> 00:15:10.020
This is exactly what I ate 30 years ago.

00:15:11.000 --> 00:15:13.300
But the passion conveyed

00:15:13.400 --> 00:15:15.910
is greater compared to the past.

00:15:16.370 --> 00:15:18.240
Could you tell me

00:15:18.480 --> 00:15:19.910
the secret about

00:15:19.960 --> 00:15:21.740
Master Jia Xiong’s Rice Crust

00:15:22.030 --> 00:15:23.820
and how to cook it?

00:15:24.880 --> 00:15:26.490
Yes. Tell us.

00:15:26.580 --> 00:15:27.280
What exactly is

00:15:27.320 --> 00:15:28.520
the magic ball?

00:15:28.620 --> 00:15:30.130
Quiet! Quiet.

00:15:30.280 --> 00:15:32.030
You’ll know it soon.

00:15:33.720 --> 00:15:35.170
Chef Mao. Please.

00:15:36.390 --> 00:15:37.900
Come on. Let’s give him a big clap.

00:15:38.510 --> 00:15:41.780
First, put the rice on the inside of the two balls.

00:15:41.860 --> 00:15:44.160
Bake the balls while rotating them.

00:15:44.870 --> 00:15:45.920
Take out the whole rice crust

00:15:46.140 --> 00:15:47.310
and put in into the heated oil

00:15:47.360 --> 00:15:49.270
for frying.

00:15:49.350 --> 00:15:51.380
This is how to make the hollow rice crust.

00:15:51.930 --> 00:15:54.610
The most awesome part is

00:15:54.690 --> 00:15:56.740
the sauce is put inside the rice crust.

00:15:57.010 --> 00:15:57.930
Wait a second, please.

00:15:58.190 --> 00:16:00.460
If the sauce is drizzled on the surface,

00:16:00.540 --> 00:16:02.310
the rice crust will get cracked.

00:16:02.720 --> 00:16:03.940
To avoid such situation,

00:16:04.350 --> 00:16:06.600
the inside of the balls must be covered

00:16:06.950 --> 00:16:08.340
with the greased beef.

00:16:08.470 --> 00:16:09.240
So

00:16:09.480 --> 00:16:10.760
with the beef,

00:16:10.830 --> 00:16:11.730
the round rice crust

00:16:11.780 --> 00:16:12.770
won't get cracked.

00:16:13.450 --> 00:16:14.950
But why do you put the sauce

00:16:15.040 --> 00:16:16.740
inside the rice crust?

00:16:17.210 --> 00:16:18.340
Compared with drizzling on the surface,

00:16:18.530 --> 00:16:20.050
there is no difference in taste.

00:16:20.470 --> 00:16:21.120
You’re wrong.

00:16:21.370 --> 00:16:23.760
When the pressure inside gets higher,

00:16:23.850 --> 00:16:25.580
the sauce will increase

00:16:25.690 --> 00:16:26.840
its flavor

00:16:26.920 --> 00:16:30.880
and it won’t get cold before being eaten.

00:16:31.390 --> 00:16:32.970
When the steam is squeezed

00:16:33.020 --> 00:16:34.050
by internal pressure,

00:16:34.410 --> 00:16:35.980
to certain extent,

00:16:36.080 --> 00:16:37.660
the rice crust ball finally

00:16:37.710 --> 00:16:38.660
gets cracked in half.

00:16:38.770 --> 00:16:40.950
Then we get the legendary rice crust.

00:16:42.920 --> 00:16:43.610
I see.

00:16:44.300 --> 00:16:45.480
The magic method

00:16:45.530 --> 00:16:48.110
contains such a profound principle.

00:16:48.750 --> 00:16:50.430
The unique tools

00:16:50.950 --> 00:16:53.260
bring visual and auditory enjoyment to people

00:16:53.690 --> 00:16:54.390
and manifest the pursuit for

00:16:54.480 --> 00:16:57.600
the most delicious food.

00:17:01.010 --> 00:17:02.060
Master Jia Xiong

00:17:02.370 --> 00:17:04.300
is really the greatest chef.

00:17:04.650 --> 00:17:05.260
That’s right.

00:17:05.590 --> 00:17:06.580
He indeed had

00:17:06.970 --> 00:17:09.880
passion like a young man.

00:17:10.500 --> 00:17:11.090
This is…

00:17:12.510 --> 00:17:13.400
As long as you

00:17:13.450 --> 00:17:15.240
stay motivated

00:17:15.520 --> 00:17:17.220
you will shine like it

00:17:17.270 --> 00:17:19.200
someday.

00:17:20.070 --> 00:17:21.620
Though I’m 80 years old,

00:17:21.670 --> 00:17:23.630
my life is just about to begin.

00:17:23.840 --> 00:17:24.880
I need to make more delicious dishes

00:17:24.930 --> 00:17:26.860
for people.

00:17:26.950 --> 00:17:28.190
Or I won’t die in peace.

00:17:30.300 --> 00:17:32.700
As long as I stay motivated,

00:17:32.790 --> 00:17:34.760
I will shine someday.

00:17:35.220 --> 00:17:36.140
That’s right.

00:17:36.520 --> 00:17:37.580
Even I, an old man,

00:17:37.630 --> 00:17:39.730
have the endless passion.

00:17:40.250 --> 00:17:41.920
Go for it,

00:17:41.960 --> 00:17:42.860
young man.

00:17:42.930 --> 00:17:43.910
Yes.

00:17:45.920 --> 00:17:47.270
See the way you’re eating.

00:17:47.390 --> 00:17:48.830
That’s it.

00:17:51.660 --> 00:17:53.060
It’s too delicious.

00:17:53.280 --> 00:17:54.020
So yummy.

00:17:54.170 --> 00:17:56.290
Dedicated himself to cooking,

00:17:57.890 --> 00:18:00.070
he's indeed a great chef.

00:18:00.800 --> 00:18:01.870
Grandfather…

00:18:02.560 --> 00:18:03.330
But I found

00:18:03.640 --> 00:18:06.450
a chef greater than Master Jia Xiong

00:18:07.000 --> 00:18:08.460
in the world.

00:18:09.550 --> 00:18:10.200
Who?

00:18:10.270 --> 00:18:12.660
More awesome than Master Jia Xiong?

00:18:13.060 --> 00:18:14.440
Who is it?

00:18:14.760 --> 00:18:15.520
It’s you.

00:18:17.580 --> 00:18:18.210
Mao.

00:18:19.730 --> 00:18:20.440
Mao.

00:18:20.940 --> 00:18:22.770
To cook a new dish,

00:18:22.810 --> 00:18:24.400
strength matters, of course.

00:18:24.690 --> 00:18:26.120
But to cook

00:18:26.160 --> 00:18:27.680
the dish that has been lost

00:18:27.770 --> 00:18:29.950
for 30 years,

00:18:30.280 --> 00:18:31.990
the chef must

00:18:32.170 --> 00:18:33.490
have the same mind

00:18:33.540 --> 00:18:36.260
as the creator.

00:18:41.440 --> 00:18:42.040
Mao.

00:18:42.080 --> 00:18:43.760
I just want to ask you one question.

00:18:44.810 --> 00:18:45.430
Miss Yanli.

00:18:48.480 --> 00:18:50.370
Faced with the challenge,

00:18:53.680 --> 00:18:54.160
why could you

00:18:54.210 --> 00:18:55.700
be so wholehearted?

00:18:56.770 --> 00:18:58.780
What are you doing for?

00:18:58.850 --> 00:19:01.450
That’s because I can’t stand that

00:19:01.560 --> 00:19:02.950
such delicious dish

00:19:03.000 --> 00:19:04.710
can only be a legend.

00:19:06.690 --> 00:19:08.920
Because of your passion for cooking,

00:19:09.250 --> 00:19:11.310
the mysterious rice crust

00:19:11.420 --> 00:19:12.670
that could have lost

00:19:12.740 --> 00:19:14.020
appears again.

00:19:14.680 --> 00:19:15.530
It’s really amazing.

00:19:16.040 --> 00:19:17.850
Awesome, Mao.

00:19:17.950 --> 00:19:19.140
You’re amazing, Mao.

00:19:20.220 --> 00:19:21.610
He praised me.

00:19:27.550 --> 00:19:28.880
You have

00:19:28.930 --> 00:19:30.110
an outstanding chef,

00:19:30.160 --> 00:19:30.690
Yanli.

00:19:31.060 --> 00:19:32.270
No, sir.

00:19:32.950 --> 00:19:34.390
Master Mao

00:19:34.830 --> 00:19:37.440
in fact doesn’t work for me.

00:19:38.010 --> 00:19:39.470
What? He doesn’t.

00:19:39.810 --> 00:19:41.130
He is

00:19:45.290 --> 00:19:48.090
the youngest Super Chef,

00:19:48.500 --> 00:19:50.290
Liu Maoxing.

00:19:50.350 --> 00:19:53.270
(Super)

00:19:58.670 --> 00:19:59.250
What?

00:19:59.320 --> 00:19:59.880
You’re

00:19:59.940 --> 00:20:00.690
the legendary

00:20:00.730 --> 00:20:02.970
genius chef.

00:20:03.070 --> 00:20:03.460
Yes, I am.

00:20:05.460 --> 00:20:06.300
It’s him.

00:20:13.620 --> 00:20:14.340
Mao.

00:20:14.640 --> 00:20:16.650
Sorry for the trouble to you.

00:20:16.700 --> 00:20:17.250
No need to say sorry.

00:20:17.680 --> 00:20:20.430
I’m happy to have the opportunity

00:20:20.480 --> 00:20:21.760
to cook Master Jia Xiong’s dish.

00:20:26.780 --> 00:20:28.790
She treated us unfriendly.

00:20:29.060 --> 00:20:31.060
Why is Mao still being so polite to her?

00:20:31.410 --> 00:20:32.440
It doesn’t matter.

00:20:32.530 --> 00:20:34.000
It’s over.

00:20:35.170 --> 00:20:36.060
Meili,

00:20:36.130 --> 00:20:37.160
Aren’t you jealous of

00:20:37.210 --> 00:20:38.470
the sexy woman?

00:20:39.650 --> 00:20:40.850
There is no need.

00:20:41.070 --> 00:20:42.290
Mao won’t like

00:20:42.340 --> 00:20:43.880
Miss Yanli.

00:20:44.360 --> 00:20:45.220
He is just a nerd

00:20:45.370 --> 00:20:47.340
who only knows cooking.

00:20:50.300 --> 00:20:51.290
Really?

00:20:52.340 --> 00:20:53.260
Because people always

00:20:53.800 --> 00:20:55.870
compare me

00:20:55.920 --> 00:20:57.740
with my grandfather,

00:20:57.820 --> 00:20:59.670
I gradually lost my energy

00:21:00.140 --> 00:21:01.160
and passion

00:21:01.210 --> 00:21:02.490
for cooking.

00:21:03.590 --> 00:21:04.270
But

00:21:05.280 --> 00:21:06.990
after seeing what you did, I thought a lot.

00:21:07.350 --> 00:21:08.940
I decided to start over

00:21:08.990 --> 00:21:10.030
and try hard.

00:21:10.250 --> 00:21:10.940
Miss Yanli.

00:21:11.840 --> 00:21:13.360
Mao, thank you.

00:21:20.750 --> 00:21:21.920
Turn around!

00:21:29.290 --> 00:21:31.070
Come on! Mao!

00:21:31.350 --> 00:21:33.430
Meili, let’s go.

00:21:33.480 --> 00:21:34.340
What’s up?

00:21:34.400 --> 00:21:36.260
Why is he shy?

00:21:36.300 --> 00:21:37.260
It’s not decent at all.

00:21:37.760 --> 00:21:40.070
I won’t spare him this time.

00:21:40.130 --> 00:21:41.650
So painful.

00:21:41.700 --> 00:21:45.110
Don’t take it out on me. Help.

00:23:15.050 --> 00:23:17.693
Preview of the next episode

00:23:17.693 --> 00:23:20.816
During the trip, I got separated from Silang and others.

00:23:20.816 --> 00:23:24.278
What a bummer! I think I've even lost my way,

00:23:24.278 --> 00:23:27.740
and I'm scared, to say the least!

00:23:28.360 --> 00:23:29.760
Next episode, Chūka Ichiban!

00:23:29.760 --> 00:23:32.577
Scary Red Congee: Secret of the Haunted Mansion

00:23:32.869 --> 00:23:34.413
It will definitely be interesting!
